{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31085","headline":"和曹侍御除夜有怀 · 薛能","name":"和曹侍御除夜有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有病无媒客，多慵亦太疎。\n自怜成叔夜，谁与荐相如。\n嗜退思年老，谙空笑岁除。\n迹闲过寺宿，头煖近阶梳。\n春立穷冬後，阳生旧物初。\n叶多庭不扫，根在迳新锄。\n田事终归彼，心情倦老於。\n斵材须见像，藏劒岂爲鱼。\n效浅慙尹禄，恩多负辟书。\n醻知必拟共，勿使浪踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}